<urn:usf:currentness:semantic-first-bootstrap-transition:1> <urn:usf:predicate:deltaDigestScope> "Canonicalize every ordered operation kind, exact old and new N-Quad source line, subject, predicate, object, graph and expected preimage. Require exactly four resource additions and the two named state replacements, with no other source or semantic operation." <urn:usf:graph:semantic-first> .
<urn:usf:currentness:semantic-first-bootstrap-transition:1> <urn:usf:predicate:postStateDigestScope> "Apply the verified delta in memory, then bind the exact post-state source digest, semantic graph digest, six-resource projections, replacement postimages, unchanged manifest/profile and unaffected scoped dependency identities, and the exact source path. Compare all of them to the current tracked source before treating active as current." <urn:usf:graph:semantic-first> .
<urn:usf:currentness:semantic-first-bootstrap-transition:1> <urn:usf:predicate:receiptExclusion> "The receipt is tracked evidence but is not imported by any semantic manifest. Its path and missing-file preimage are bound by the pre-state basis, while its expected creation is removed only from the unchanged-dependency comparison; its content bytes are excluded from the semantic delta and post-state semantic digests to avoid self-reference. Every closed field is independently recomputed, so changing, omitting or adding a field refuses rather than becoming authority." <urn:usf:graph:semantic-first> .
