<urn:usf:requirement:semantic-definition-activation-separation> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Keep an authored SemanticContract definition distinct from proof-warranted RealisationPermission. A proofblocked definition grants no construction, contact, integration, publication, runtime or completion authority; only an exact typed BootstrapConstructionException may bound the one local isolated check-only gate construction." <urn:usf:graph:semantic-first> .
