<urn:usf:requirement:semantic-first-test-economics> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Use one table-driven semantic eligibility test, one table-driven cross-transition basis test and one lifecycle sibling-isolation test; replace duplicate matrices rather than multiplying tests per command, provider, model or stage." <urn:usf:graph:semantic-first> .
