<urn:usf:acceptance:semantic-transition-receipt-currentness> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "The closed tracked receipt is outside semantic manifests, exactly reverses the current post-state to the proven pre-state, reproduces the exact admitted delta and post-state, keeps the warranted activation current, and refuses a changed receipt, operation, preimage, postimage, source, scoped dependency or extra effect." <urn:usf:graph:semantic-first> .
